<view class="warn-banner">在本页改、保存即生效，每次修改都记入操作记录。只有管理员能保存；价格从配置读，不写死在代码里。</view>
<view wx:if="{{loading}}"><view class="note">加载中…</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card"><view class="note">{{error}}（配置读写需要管理员身份：把你的账号加进管理员名单后重试）</view></view>

<!-- 额度与价格 -->
<block wx:if="{{!loading && !error && section === 'pricing'}}">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-val" style="font-weight:bold">免费额度</text></view>
    <view class="form-row" wx:for="{{quotaFields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">{{item.label}}</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{freeQuota[item.key]}}" data-group="freeQuota" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="onQuotaInput" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-val" style="font-weight:bold">会员额度</text></view>
    <view class="form-row" wx:for="{{quotaFields}}" wx:key="key"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">{{item.label}}</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{memberQuota[item.key]}}" data-group="memberQuota" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindinput="onQuotaInput" /></view>
    <view class="note">买套餐的会员按下面各自档位卡片里的额度走；这组「会员额度」只给后台手动开通、没有档位的会员兜底。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-val" style="font-weight:bold">会员价格档位（价格单位：元）</text></view>
    <view wx:if="{{pricingFromStatic}}" class="note">当前显示的是占位档位（待定价），保存后以这里为准。</view>
    <view class="plan" wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">名称</text><input class="form-val" value="{{item.name}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">价格（元）</text><input class="form-val" type="digit" value="{{item.yuan}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="yuan" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">天数</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.days}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="days" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">赠送积分</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.grantPoints}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="grantPoints" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">额度·礼薄数</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.qEvents}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="qEvents" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">额度·每礼薄条数</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.qPerEvent}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="qPerEvent" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">额度·送礼条数</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.qGifts}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="qGifts" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">额度·联系人数</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.qContacts}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="qContacts" bindinput="onPlanInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">标推荐</text><switch checked="{{item.recommended}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="recommended" bindchange="onPlanToggle" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">上架</text><switch checked="{{item.onShelf}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="onShelf" bindchange="onPlanToggle" /><text class="ph">关掉即一键下架，购买页不显示</text></view>
      <view class="del" bindtap="onDelPlan" data-idx="{{index}}">删除这个档位</view>
    </view>
    <view class="add" bindtap="onAddPlan">＋ 添加档位</view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSavePricing" loading="{{saving}}">保存额度与价格</button>
</block>

<!-- 功能开关 -->
<block wx:if="{{!loading && !error && section === 'switches'}}">
  <view class="group-h">总开关</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">拍照导入</text><switch checked="{{launch.photoImportEnabled}}" bindchange="onLaunchToggle" data-key="photoImportEnabled" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">电子请柬</text><switch checked="{{gates.eInvitation}}" bindchange="onGateToggle" data-key="eInvitation" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">家庭共享</text><switch checked="{{gates.familyShare}}" bindchange="onGateToggle" data-key="familyShare" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">横置礼单本</text><switch checked="{{gates.landscape}}" bindchange="onGateToggle" data-key="landscape" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">维护模式</text><switch checked="{{gates.maintenance}}" bindchange="onGateToggle" data-key="maintenance" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">新用户注册</text><switch checked="{{gates.registration}}" bindchange="onGateToggle" data-key="registration" /></view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSaveMaster" loading="{{saving}}">保存总开关</button>
  <view class="note">总开关管「功能开和关」，对所有人一样（会员也一样）：关掉后谁都用不了。拍照导入：关掉后入口提示敬请期待、服务端拒绝。电子请柬：关掉后首页入口不显示（还要配了合作方 AppID 才显示）。家庭共享：关掉后入口提示敬请期待，共享的新建/接受/改权限/移除/列表在服务端同步拒绝，已共享记录不删除。横置礼单本：关掉后个人开关开着也进不去横置。维护模式：打开后非管理员只看到「系统维护中」，管理员不受限。注册：关掉后新用户进不来，老用户不受影响。</view>

  <view class="group-h">会员功能</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row" wx:for="{{featureFields}}" wx:key="key">
      <text class="form-label" style="width:170px">{{item.label}}</text>
      <switch checked="{{featureChecked[item.key]}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindchange="onMemberSwitch" />
    </view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSaveFeatures" loading="{{saving}}">保存会员功能</button>
  <view class="note">这一组管「算不算会员专属」：打开的功能只有会员能用，关掉后免费用户也能用。和总开关的区别：总开关管功能本身开不开，这组管谁能用。（拍照导入关掉专属后，免费用户也能用，但每次扣 5 分的规则不变。）</view>

  <view class="group-h">支付开关</view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">云端购买</text><switch checked="{{launch.paymentEnabled}}" bindchange="onLaunchToggle" data-key="paymentEnabled" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">iPhone（iOS）购买入口</text><switch checked="{{platforms.ios}}" data-key="ios" bindchange="onPlatformToggle" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">安卓（Android）购买入口</text><switch checked="{{platforms.android}}" data-key="android" bindchange="onPlatformToggle" /></view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSavePayment" loading="{{saving}}">保存支付开关</button>
  <view class="note">云端购买是买东西的总闸：关掉后普通用户买不了（提示暂未开放），管理员可模拟购买；真实支付接入后再打开。iOS/安卓入口：关掉某个终端后，该终端的购买页只显示提示、不出现购买按钮。邀请奖励在老板平台「邀请奖励」页里改（设置与数据同页）。</view>
</block>


<!-- 积分规则 -->
<block wx:if="{{!loading && !error && section === 'points'}}">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-val" style="font-weight:bold">积分规则</text></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">新用户注册赠送（分）</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{pointsCfg.registerGrant}}" data-key="registerGrant" bindinput="onPointsInput" /></view>
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label" style="width:170px">拍照录入单价（分/次）</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{pointsCfg.photoImportCost}}" data-key="photoImportCost" bindinput="onPointsInput" /></view>
  </view>
  <view class="card">
    <view class="form-row"><text class="form-val" style="font-weight:bold">积分礼包（仅会员可买）</text></view>
    <view class="plan" wx:for="{{packs}}" wx:key="id">
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">名称</text><input class="form-val" value="{{item.name}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="name" bindinput="onPackInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">价格（元）</text><input class="form-val" type="digit" value="{{item.yuan}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="yuan" bindinput="onPackInput" /></view>
      <view class="form-row"><text class="form-label">积分</text><input class="form-val" type="number" value="{{item.points}}" data-idx="{{index}}" data-field="points" bindinput="onPackInput" /></view>
      <view class="del" bindtap="onDelPack" data-idx="{{index}}">删除这个礼包</view>
    </view>
    <view class="add" bindtap="onAddPack">＋ 添加礼包</view>
  </view>
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="onSavePoints" loading="{{saving}}">保存积分规则</button>
  <view class="note">积分不过期；改单价/赠送只影响之后的新订单与新注册，历史流水不变。</view>
</block>

